Package: gamayun-nas
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Serzhdrako13 <serzhdrako13@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Serzhdrako13/gamayun-nas
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, udev, util-linux, mount, procps, passwd, sudo, openssh-server, samba, samba-common-bin, samba-vfs-modules, cryptsetup-bin, dmsetup, mdadm, lvm2, btrfs-progs, gdisk, smartmontools, fail2ban, python3-systemd, nftables
Recommends: smbclient, avahi-daemon
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: GamayunNas — home NAS (alpha)
 Management daemon gamayund (HTTPS API and web interface), privileged helper
 gamayun-helper and early dm-integrity activation (gamayun-integrity).
 Storage pools (RAID/SHR on mdadm + LVM + Btrfs with optional dm-integrity),
 SMB/SFTP shares, users, snapshots, notifications, scheduled scrub and SMART.
 Configuration (/var/lib/gamayun-nas) and pools survive package removal
 and reinstallation.
